    ]
  },
  "failure_conditions": [
    "An edge atom whose own lines do not force r0 = r1 = r2 = not p, or leave an inner point or pair of inner points fixed; a placement where an atom meets the glue elsewhere; a switching set whose complement does not map the signed glue's solutions onto the other placement's; or a computed glue block or switched signed glue whose creation map differs."
